         Modify description for vip-mac-user mac-address node.
       2.Add node for access user DTLS car mode.
       3.Modify the lower and upper threshold value range of the quiet-alarm node.
       4.Delete the must condition of in-accounting-start-type node;
         Add the must condition of in-accounting-start-type node.;
       5.Add leaf description;
         Add leaf mac-address.;
       6.Add leaf mlag-enable;
         Add leaf mlag-traffic-sync-interval;
         Add leaf dual-syn-enable;
         Add leaf dual-syn-intval.";
